Z||000000||Wolfhound||02-25-2001||06:26 AM||||I bought a running 86 4 cyl, 5 speed with a totaled body. Kissed a tree! Pulled the rear tires yesterday to move another one and look what I found  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bdisk.JPG"> <BR>How could anyone drive a car to the point the disk is GONE! This had to make a hell of a noise for a long time. This is the drivers side rear, recon it caused this!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck.JPG"> ||||reg||1
